# Build context for every Dockerfile in this repo (context = repository root). Keep secrets, VCS data, CI/agent
# configuration, docs and local build output out of the context so none of it can reach an image layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.stryker-tmp
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.git
.github
.claude
.cursor
docs

# Secrets: environment files (only the fake-valued example is allowed), keys and certificates.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
